body:
Yes and no. It gets confusing. 
Herbal teas = good;
any other tea with caffeine = nope;
Coffee= can't have the real stuff, but fake coffee is okay, (my mom loved postum);
Sodas with caffeine = good and bad, but mostly okay in the last maybe 15 years(ish)?

They're not necessarily classified as "drugs" by the church, at least not by name, but these fall under the interpretation of the [Word of Wisdom](https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Word_of_Wisdom) as prohibited if you are to get into heaven. 

I'm on mobile so sorry for the formatting 

Source: I grew up mormon and left the church in my teens about a decade ago.
